# A checkout is byte-identical on every platform. The ledger is bytes-appended-
# only, tests/fleet_conventions.json is pinned by sha256, and the gate scripts
# run under Git Bash on the Windows leg; Git for Windows defaults to
# core.autocrlf=true, which rewrote every text file to CRLF there (PR #297).
* text=auto eol=lf
*.db binary
